' Data Flow Annotations
note right of MainEngine
  **Enhanced DSS Algorithm Flow:**

  1. Extract & validate competencies
  2. Normalize weights (85% comp, 15% location)
  3. Filter qualified talents (mandatory)
  4. Apply veto thresholds (critical)
  5. Min-max normalize performance values
  6. Calculate SAW scores with bonuses
  7. Generate confidence & sensitivity
  8. Rank and limit results (10 max)
end note

note left of CriticalSystem
  **Critical Competency Features:**

  • Maximum 70% can be critical
  • Veto threshold: 60-100%
  • Progressive bonuses up to 20%
  • Automatic elimination logic
  • Business rule enforcement
end note

note bottom of MathCore
  **Mathematical Compliance:**

  Standards: International MCDM/SAW
  Normalization: Min-Max with edge cases
  Bounds: [0,1] enforcement
  Validation: Academic compliance
  Edge Cases: Zero-range handling
end note

note top of Analytics
  **Advanced Analytics Features:**

  • Multi-factor confidence scoring
  • Weight sensitivity analysis
  • Ranking stability testing
  • Performance robustness metrics
  • Statistical validation
end note

note right of LocIntel
  **Location Intelligence Components:**

  Scoring Factors:
  • Country match: 50%
  • City proximity: 30%
  • Timezone compatibility: 20%

  Work Type Adjustments:
  • Remote: neutral (0.5)
  • Hybrid: reduced (0.7)
  • On-site: full scoring
end note

@enduml
